# Google Gemini API key (OPTIONAL).
# Without it, AI features fall back to mock/sample data.
#
# ⚠️ SECURITY: Vite inlines every VITE_-prefixed variable into the client bundle,
# so this key WILL be visible to anyone who opens the app. For production, proxy
# Gemini calls through a backend (e.g. a Firebase Cloud Function) that holds the
# key as a server-side secret, instead of shipping it to the browser.
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=
